    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 ENTER THE MAGIC ARENA \u2013 COMBINE ELEMENTS &amp; UNLEASH DESTRUCTION! \ud83d\udd25</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the <strong>ultimate battle arena</strong>, where only the strongest will survive! In <strong>MAGLA</strong>, you'll fight against waves of enemies, level up, and unlock devastating skills by combining powerful elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f  ACTION COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to gain experience, level up, and unlock <strong>unique upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Item Cards</strong> to enhance your abilities and customize your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine Fire, Ice, and Earth</strong> to create powerful, game-changing skills!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong>\u2744\u00a0<strong>ELEMENTAL SPELL SYSTEM\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire</strong>: High damage, burns enemies over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ice</strong>: Slows down enemies and can form deadly <strong>Ice Swords &amp; Ice Spears</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth</strong>: Summon <strong>Tornadoes</strong> and unleash <strong>Lightning Strikes</strong> to devastate the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix them to unleash devastating magic!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1<strong> EVERY RUN IS A NEW STRATEGY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>Upgrade Cards</strong> each time you level up to shape your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you focus on <strong>raw firepower</strong>, <strong>freezing blades</strong>, or <strong>storm-infused destruction</strong>?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dominate the <strong>magic arena</strong>? Step in and prove your power to the world!</p>",
